                <mxCell id="207" value="&lt;ol style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: rgb(220, 220, 220) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scrollbar-width: thin; letter-spacing: 0.3px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 30px; padding-inline-start: 5px; color: rgb(73, 74, 76); font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: rgb(220, 220, 220) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scrollbar-width: thin; letter-spacing: 0.3px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: rgb(220, 220, 220) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scrollbar-width: thin; letter-spacing: 0.3px !important; margin: 0px 0px 2px; word-break: break-word; min-height: 15px;&quot;&gt;This project will implement a Sobel edge detection filter. The system will first apply the filter to a static grayscale image stored in memory and display the processed result through the VGA output. After the basic implementation, the system will be extended to support color images.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18));&quot;&gt;The system will be further extended to apply the filter to real-time video input from a camera.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.3px; background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18));&quot;&gt;And additional features such as facial recognition could be added.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.3px;&quot;&gt;Additionally, part of the Sobel computation may be implemented in FPGA hardware to accelerate the filtering process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-130" y="380" width="880" height="130" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
